  ("include females, so in notices and pamphlets one sometimes sees alumn@s, candidat@s, etc. L@s" 0.0920 0.9080 0.0832 0.0997 0.0997 0.0165 0.00482 0.3403 0.0636 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" 0.0136 nil nil 0)
