  ("and a few other masculine nouns can be used to refer to women, most of them, involving sexual" 0.0920 0.9080 0.8238 0.8403 0.8403 0.0165 0.00482 0.3637 0.0326 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" 0.0136 nil nil 0)
  ("innuendo or comparisons with objects, cf. el pendón ‘trollop’/‘slut’ (lit. ‘pennant’, also la pendona)," 0.0920 0.9081 0.8404 0.8568 0.8568 0.0165 0.00482 0.3552 0.0824 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" 0.0136 nil nil 0)
