  ("(j)  Numbers (el número): un seis, un 5, la Generación del 98 the ‘Generation of ’98’, el dos por ciento" 0.0920 0.9080 0.6124 0.6289 0.6289 0.0165 0.00482 0.3397 0.0241 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" 0.0136 nil nil 1)
  ("‘two per cent’." 0.0920 0.2136 0.6289 0.6454 0.6454 0.0165 0.00482 0.3739 0.0382 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" 0.0136 nil nil 0)
  ("(k)  Musical notes: el fa, el la (underlying noun unclear)." 0.0920 0.5615 0.6576 0.6741 0.6741 0.0165 0.00482 0.3612 0.0294 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" 0.0136 nil nil 1)
  ("(l)  Colours (el color): el azul ‘blue’, el ocre ‘ochre’; se amplía el naranja del horizonte ‘the orange of the" 0.0920 0.9080 0.6863 0.7028 0.7028 0.0165 0.00482 0.3305 0.0241 "UFSJES+Palatino-Italic" 0.0136 nil t 1)
  ("horizon is spreading’ (AG, Sp.), mandaron instalar una alfombra verde aunque no hiciera juego con el" 0.0920 0.9080 0.7028 0.7193 0.7193 0.0165 0.00482 0.3065 0.0663 "UFSJES+Palatino-Italic" 0.0136 nil t 0)
  ("rosa pálido de las paredes (ES, Mex.) ‘they had a green carpet laid even though it didn’t match the" 0.0920 0.9080 0.7193 0.7358 0.7358 0.0165 0.00482 0.3205 0.0318 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" 0.0136 nil nil 0)
  ("pale pink of the walls’." 0.0920 0.2852 0.7358 0.7522 0.7522 0.0165 0.00482 0.3673 0.0360 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" 0.0136 nil nil 0)
